hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"24012","Narrated to us Waki, narrated to us Hisham ibn Saad, from Zayd ibn Aslam, from Abd al-Rahman ibn Ata, from a group of Banu Salamah, they said: The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) was sitting, then he tore his garment and said: I have promised a sacrificial animal to be marked today."
